## Model card

- **Name:** Grok-5
- **Short description:** xAI's upcoming Grok series successor to Grok-4, in active training as of January 2026; launch delayed to Q1 2026; described by Elon Musk as a 6 trillion parameter MoE model; positioned toward AGI; anticipated real-time video understanding; proprietary, weights not public.
- **Provider / access:** xAI API (expected, `grok-5`, Chat Completions); not yet publicly available.
- **Release / knowledge:** Delayed to Q1 2026; training began late September/early October 2025; knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `grok-5` (xAI API, expected). No Free ID confirmed.
- **Context window:** Not confirmed; Grok-2 used 128K tokens; Grok-5 context window not disclosed.
- **Modalities:** Text anticipated; real-time video understanding anticipated per Musk claims; not yet released so no confirmed modalities.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-20):** Not available — model not yet released.
- **Architecture:** Claimed 6T parameter MoE (Musk claim, unverified); proprietary; training on Colossus supercluster (1M+ H100 GPU equivalents).

